BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Specialty Coffee: From Your First Brew to Barista for Newcomer Ent
 repreneurs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T193000
UID:6a91d0c737716d0d1ad7166e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to take your love of coffee beyond a cup of cappuccino? T
 hinking about opening your own café or launching a coffee brand? Explore 
 real-world career paths in coffee - from café barista to roaster to coffe
 e entrepreneur. Find your entry point in this industry and learn about wha
 t works\, what doesn’t\, and what to avoid.\nPresented by Hong Dai\, own
 er of Another Land Coffee\, a specialty coffee shop located in North York\
 , with over 15 years of experience in the specialty coffee and hospitality
  industry.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a91d0c737716d0d1ad7166e
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
